# CMS22 BP Control Cognitive Support — caseload

// Scenario: a patient with previously-confirmed hypertension presents
// for a routine wellness visit. Their BP reading is hypertensive. The
// CMS22 BP Control Strategy decision walks the hypertensive-reading
// branch and the Recommend Hypertension Intervention sub-decision
// chooses the antihypertensive-medication-order path.
//
// This case exercises the decision-tree path:
//   CMS22 BP Control Strategy
//     when Patient Eligible For BP Cognitive Support
//       when Has Hypertensive Reading
//         use decision Recommend Hypertension Intervention
//           when Has Confirmed Hypertension Diagnosis
//             any: recommend Order Antihypertensive Medication

library "CMS22 BP Cognitive Support — Hypertensive Reading".
covers "CMS22 BP Control Cognitive Support Example".


// ============ Patient facts ============

fact "Robert Lee":
- name is "Robert Lee".
- birth date is "1958-11-04".
- defined by "Patient".


// ============ Clinical facts ============

fact "Wellness Visit":
- code is "http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/hcpcs|G0438".
- date is "2026-04-12".
- defined by "Encounter".

fact "Confirmed Hypertension Diagnosis":
- code is "http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm|I10".
- date is "2024-05-12".
- defined by "CMS22 BP Control Cognitive Support Example"."Hypertension Diagnoses".

fact "Hypertensive BP Reading":
- code is "http://loinc.org|85354-9".
- date is "2026-04-12".
- defined by "CMS22 BP Control Cognitive Support Example"."BP Reading".

fact "Hypertensive Systolic":
- code is "http://loinc.org|8480-6".
- date is "2026-04-12".
- value is 152.
- defined by "CMS22 BP Control Cognitive Support Example"."Standalone Systolic BP Observations".

fact "Hypertensive Diastolic":
- code is "http://loinc.org|8462-4".
- date is "2026-04-12".
- value is 96.
- defined by "CMS22 BP Control Cognitive Support Example"."Standalone Diastolic BP Observations".


// ============ Cases ============

case "Robert: hypertensive reading triggers antihypertensive recommendation":
- description is `Robert is eligible for BP cognitive support and has a
  hypertensive reading at his wellness encounter. He has a confirmed
  hypertension diagnosis on file, so the Recommend Hypertension
  Intervention sub-decision selects the antihypertensive-medication
  branch.`.
- subject is "Robert Lee".
- fact is "Wellness Visit".
- fact is "Confirmed Hypertension Diagnosis".
- fact is "Hypertensive BP Reading".
- fact is "Hypertensive Systolic".
- fact is "Hypertensive Diastolic".
- result is "CMS22 BP Control Strategy" is "Order Antihypertensive Medication".
